OL,3,CMan who hid victim's body in concrete
OL,4,Cguilty of murder
OL,6,FA man who concealed his victim's body
OL,7,Fin a concrete-filled barrel has been
OL,8,Fconvicted of murder following a six-
OL,9,Fyear cover-up.
OL,11,FChristopher Wright, 73, was found
OL,12,Fguilty at Sheffield Crown Court of the
OL,13,Fmurder of 55-year-old Richard Dyson,
OL,14,Fwho disappeared in November 2019.
OL,16,FMr Dyson's remains were found at a
OL,17,Fproperty in Broadcarr Road, Barnsley,
OL,18,Fin July 2025.
OL,20,FA post-mortem examination confirmed he
OL,21,Fhad been shot.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G1/7
