PN,33202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F332A1785264513
OL,3,CMan who hid victim's body in concrete
OL,4,Cguilty of murder
OL,6,FThe investigation into Mr Dyson's
OL,7,Fdeath began as a missing person
OL,8,Finvestigation after he failed to meet
OL,9,Fhis daughter Bethany as planned.
OL,11,FOver the next six years, several
OL,12,Fappeals were made by police.
OL,14,FYears later, detectives at South
OL,15,FYorkshire Police learned how Wright
OL,16,Fand Richard had previously fallen out
OL,17,Fover unconfirmed "stolen guns".
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G2/7
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,333,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F332A1785264513
OL,3,CMan who hid victim's body in concrete
OL,4,Cguilty of murder
OL,6,FIn July 2025, a fresh review of mobile
OL,7,Fevidence found Wright had phoned the
OL,8,Fowner of nearby Alderthwaite Farm
OL,9,Fthree days after Dyson was last known
OL,10,Fto be alive.
OL,12,FA written diary entry kept by the
OL,13,Ffarm's owner confirmed Wright had
OL,14,Fasked to leave a trailer at the farm
OL,15,Ffor a few days but had not returned to
OL,16,Fcollect it.
OL,18,FWhen police attended Alderthwaite Farm
OL,19,Fin July 2025, they discovered a blue
OL,20,Fplastic barrel, filled with concrete
OL,21,Fcontaining Mr Dyson's remains.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G3/7
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,333,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F332A1785264513
OL,3,CMan who hid victim's body in concrete
OL,4,Cguilty of murder
OL,6,FA name badge bearing Wright's name was
OL,7,Falso found in the trailer.
OL,9,FExpert analysis of firearms and
OL,10,Fammunition recovered from Wright's
OL,11,Fhome address matched the type used to
OL,12,Fkill Mr Dyson.
OL,14,FThe prosecution charged Wright with
OL,15,Fmultiple firearms offences, as it was
OL,16,Fdiscovered his licence to own them had
OL,17,Fbeen revoked in 2016.
OL,19,FWright's childhood friend, Karl
OL,20,FSchwalbe, 72, was found guilty of
OL,21,Fhelping Wright to conceal the crime.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G4/7
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,333,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F332A1785264513
OL,3,CMan who hid victim's body in concrete
OL,4,Cguilty of murder
OL,6,FThe court heard how telephone calls
OL,7,Fbetween Wright and Schwalbe had taken
OL,8,Fplace and Schwalbe assisted Wright in
OL,9,Fmoving the trailer.
OL,11,FWright, of Sheffield Road, Barnsley,
OL,12,Fwas also found guilty of conspiracy to
OL,13,Fpervert the course of justice, prevent
OL,14,Funlawful burial and firearms offences.
OL,16,FWright and Schwalbe, of Dike Hill,
OL,17,FRotherham, will appear at Sheffield
OL,18,FCrown Court on 6 August for sentencing.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G5/7
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,333,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F332A1785264513
OL,3,CMan who hid victim's body in concrete
OL,4,Cguilty of murder
OL,6,FJamie Barton, of the Crown Prosecution
OL,7,FService, said: "For six years, Richard
OL,8,FDyson's loved ones were left without
OL,9,Fany answers about what had happened to
OL,10,Fhim.
OL,12,F"Despite Christopher Wright's
OL,13,Fpersistent attempts to thwart police
OL,14,Finvestigations and cover up his
OL,15,Fcrimes, we were able to work with
OL,16,FSouth Yorkshire Police to gather
OL,17,Fevidence and present it in court to
OL,18,Fexpose his guilt.
OL,26,@oD@POUtD@AOU
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G6/7
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,333,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33207
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F332A1785264513
OL,3,CMan who hid victim's body in concrete
OL,4,Cguilty of murder
OL,6,F"Wright brutally murdered Richard
OL,7,FDyson, and then enlisted his lifelong
OL,8,Ffriend to help cover his tracks.
OL,9,FSchwalbe may not have pulled the
OL,10,Ftrigger, but his lies and actions were
OL,11,Fpart of a deliberate attempt to stop
OL,12,Fjustice ever being delivered."
OL,14,FDet Ch Insp Andy Knowles, of South
OL,15,FYorkshire Police added: "No verdict
OL,16,Fcan erase what (Mr Dyson's family)
OL,17,Fhave been through, but I hope it
OL,18,Fbrings them a measure of clarity and
OL,19,Fthe first steps towards healing. They
OL,20,Fhave carried a burden no family should
OL,21,Fever have to bear."
OL,26,@nD@AOUwD@YOUxD@PpmxD@bpn
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G7/7
